OL,3,ALetter making claims about Meghan's
OL,4,Afather written by his first wife, BBC
OL,5,Aunderstands
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt has been reported that images of
OL,8,Fchild sexual abuse allegedly belonging
OL,9,Fto Markle, 82, had been found in his
OL,10,Fformer home in the Philippines. Markle,
OL,11,Fwho is based in the US, denies all such
OL,12,Fallegations.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
