OL,3,ASerbia's veteran ruler VuDMiDG concedes
OL,4,Aelection to student-led protest
OL,5,Amovement
OL,6,
OL,7,FVuDMiDG had called the snap elections
OL,8,Fafter two years of protests triggered
OL,9,Fby the 2024 collapse of a train station
OL,10,Fcanopy in the city of Novi Sad, which
OL,11,Fkilled 16 and was seen as emblematic of
OL,12,Fcorruption and negligence in Serbia.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
