OL,3,ADeeply divided Israel braces for
OL,4,Apivotal election
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter three years of regional war, this
OL,7,Fis a battle Israel always knew was
OL,8,Fcoming.
OL,10,FThe general election on Tuesday hangs
OL,11,Fover a country that's deeply divided
OL,12,Fand ready for a fight.
OL,14,FPolls published on Friday put the
OL,15,Fgoverning coalition and the main
OL,16,Fopposition bloc almost neck-and-neck,
OL,17,Fwith half a million first-time voters
OL,18,Fdue to cast their ballot and some
OL,19,F70,000 Israelis reportedly flying in
OL,20,Ffrom abroad specifically to vote.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
